 class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.80 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Looks the same as a vial of <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20%28Liquid%29\">Slime</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wonder%20Glue\">Wonder Glue</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Beaver%20Bait\">Flask with Beaver Bait</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Paint\">Flask with Paint</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Poison\">Flask of Poison</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Plant%20Poison\">Flask of Plant Poison</a>.\nItem needed for 5th mission of <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a>.\nCan ONLY be purchased from <a href=\"#/wiki/Siflind\">Siflind</a> during 5th mission of <a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a> and you must have completed mission 4 of <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>, otherwise she will say that she is out of stock.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Siflind\">Siflind</a><sup>1</sup></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Nibelor\">Nibelor</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">400 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"item-notes\"><b>Notes:</b><ol><li id=\"w-notes-1\">During a quest and by saying <i>item name</i>.</li></ol></div></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Plant%20Poison\">Flask of Plant Poison</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Poison\">Flask of Poison</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Beaver%20Bait\">Flask with Beaver Bait</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20with%20Paint\">Flask with Paint</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/in-service-of-yalahar-quest\">In Service of Yalahar Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Siflind\">Siflind</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Slime%20%28Liquid%29\">Slime (Liquid)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wonder%20Glue\">Wonder Glue</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["in-service-of-yalahar-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"in-service-of-yalahar-quest","quest":"In Service of Yalahar Quest","step":"7-3","n":37,"title":"Comprar o Animal Cure","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":32361,"y":31029,"z":6,"label":"Siflind"}]}],"buy":[{"npc":"Siflind","where":"Nibelor","price":400,"pos":{"x":32361,"y":31029,"z":6},"href":"#/wiki/Siflind"}]}}